			"descriptionHtml": "<p><em style=\"font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(61, 73, 105); font-family: Proxima, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">*Click here to <a href=\"https://ca.krisplus.com/redirect?screen=makan_intermediary&redirectPath=restaurants?keyword=P.S.O%20Beach%20Club\" style=\"font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(61, 73, 105); text-decoration: none; background-color: transparent;\"><u style=\"font-weight: 300; box-sizing: border-box;\">Reserve A Table</u></a>.</em></p><p>Escape the city’s hustle and into a chic, tropical respite framed by lush greenery and a striking pool a place to slow down, sip well and savour delicious bites. Picture a striking pool, comfy cabanas and daybeds, a lively swim up bar and an atmosphere that moves effortlessly from languid daytime lounging to electric evenings. Whether you’re after a long, lazy lunch, pre dinner cocktails or a night out, P.S.O. Beach Club turns every visit into a mini getaway.</p><p><br></p><p>Mingle over playful appetisers like our addictive Sweet Potato Fries dusted with sour plum powder, or indulge in the satisfying crunch of our Korean Fried Chicken. Moving to mains, it’s a celebration of upscale comfort: bite into the stacked P.S.O. Beef Burger featuring premium Angus beef and smoky barbecue sauce, enjoy thick battered Halibut Fish & Chips, or discover the perfect plant-based bite with our hearty Vegan Burger.</p><p><br></p><p>No beach club experience is complete without the perfect pour. Toast to the stylish vibe with a Mint Pinacolada, a refreshing Jade Shore mocktail, or explore our curated selection of Provence Rosés and local craft beers. Every sip and every bite is designed to elevate your getaway.</p><p><br></p><p>Note: ALL points from Accor Live Limitless Loyalty programme can be utilized/earned in conjunction with payments via Kris+. All Accor Plus Explorer (paid membership) discounts and vouchers cannot be utilized in conjunction with Kris+ payments.</p>",
